Incident "1" -- "0..*" Road : contains >
Route "0..*" -- "1..*" Road : follows >
Mission "0..1" -- "0..*" Route : uses >
Track "0..1" -- "0..1" Case : becomes >
Request "0..1" -- "0..1" Case : becomes >
Case "1" -- "0..*" Event : history >
